# Gate log terminals at the south wall. Read-only: the cleansing in numbers.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Log

%rec: Nodes

name: Log
npc: SOUTH GATE // EBI PERIMETER LOG
+ Airlock cycles today: 3. Outbound cargo: 2 trucks, sealed, EBI plate. Inbound: none.
+ Remains in the dead field: 412. Recovery: not scheduled.
#
o_text: Who signed the cleansing order?
o_id: wall_order
o_goto: Order
#
o_text: (Log off.)
o_id: wall_leave
o_goto: End

name: Order
npc: ORDER 77-S. Issued by: Eschaton Bureau of Integration. Countersigned: Bushido-ArmaTech, munitions.
+ Status: complete. Notes: none.
#
o_text: (Log off.)
o_id: order_leave
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: The screen goes back to the airlock counter.
effect: EndConversation
